<title>USA: Olsten Corp acquires information tech firm.</title>
<headline>Olsten Corp acquires information tech firm.</headline>
<dateline>MELVILLE, N.Y. 1996-09-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Olsten Corp said Thursday that it has acquired Harvey Consultants Ltd, a private British information technology company.</p>
<p>Terms of the acquisition, which was made through Olsten subsidiary IMI Systems Inc were not disclosed.</p>
<p>Harvey, which has annual revenues of about $22 million and is based in Burton-on-Trent, is Olsten's fourth acquisition this year, the company said.</p>
</text>
